ype":"artist","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/label/3618424/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"3618424","image":"https://i.discogs.com/gyLmPmR5rHd14g_5HH1ikfwvly5QE3sd1o9iqODa8v0/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTM2MTg0/MjQtMTczMDMwNjI3/OC03NTYzLmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/0bi51cLbz8HmD1kqxoGkAk_-KzLaRbTamZKDcl3BF18/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9MLTM2MTg0/MjQtMTczMDMwNjI3/OC03NTYzLmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"After 25 years of [l2852], [a12865] released his final album called ‘FURTHER’. It was time for a new chapter, it’s time to take things FURTHER. With a focus on more forward thinking music, the label FURTHER has been in the plans for awhile.\r\n\r\nBone decided to kick off the new label FURTHER with a release from Yeti Mind Tricks titled ‘We Ain’t Like Them’, due to those words uttered throughout the track. He knew that this was more than a track: it was a raw and to-the-point description of himself and the entire FURTHER crew.\r\n\r\nAs with DJ Bone's previous label [l2852], FURTHER will be operated as a non-profit entity, with all label profits directed to Homeless Homies.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:3618424","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/3618424-Further-4","type":"label","urls":["https://djbone313.bandcamp.com","https://www.instagram.com/djbonegoesfurther/","https://music.apple.com/nl/curator/dj-bone-goes-further/1697427390?l=en-GB"]}},"/api/discogs/label/3694612/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"3694612","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"Label run by [a=Ferdy Unger-Hamilton] in cooperation with [l=Sony Music Entertainment UK Limited].\r\nAlso see publisher [l=Promised Land Music Ltd.].","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:label:3694612","relations":{"parentLabel":null,"sublabels":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/label/3694612-Promis